# Machine-specific files (each contributor keeps their own)
# NOTE: CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT here. It is the project's house rules, not a
# machine-specific file -- it contains no local paths -- and it is tracked so the rules
# live in version history and update with the commit that changes them. It was ignored
# until 2026-07-29, which is why an earlier commit added a hand-copied snapshot; that
# snapshot is gone, because a copy silently drifts from the file it is meant to mirror.
build_and_deploy.bat
.claude/

# Build output (CMake generated)
/build/

# Release packages
/Releases/

# RE artifacts — NEVER in this repo. See "WHAT NEVER ENTERS THE REPO" in CLAUDE.md.
# The repo is meant to be publishable so others can help, so everything in it must be OURS:
# no decompiler output, no disassembly, and no Ghidra/Frida probes -- a probe quotes the code
# it attaches to in its patterns and comments. All of it lives in ../FFXII-Decompile/.
# These patterns are a backstop for accidental co-location, not the policy itself; the policy
# also covers pasted game-code snippets inside Docs/, which no ignore rule can catch.
/Docs/Scripts/
*.java
frida/
ghidra/
probes/
/Docs/**/*.js

# ff12-module-loader: reference-only clone (BSD-2, NOT used in build) with its own
# .git — exclude the whole tree so it isn't committed as a broken embedded gitlink.
# (Add it as a proper submodule later if it's ever needed in-repo.)
/third_party/ff12-module-loader/

# C++ build artifacts (in case any land outside /build/)
*.obj
*.o
*.lib
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exp
*.ilk

# Windows
NUL
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
